### CodeIgniter 3 Example
```php
<?php

class Chatbot {
    private $rules = [
        'hello' => 'Hello! How can I assist you today?',
        'how are you' => 'I am just a computer program, so I don\'t have feelings.',
        'bye' => 'Goodbye! Have a great day!',
        'default' => 'I don\'t understand that. Can you please rephrase your question?',
    ];

    public function respond($input) {
        $input = strtolower($input);
        foreach ($this->rules as $key => $value) {
            if (strpos($input, $key) !== false) {
                return $value;
            }
        }
        return $this->rules['default'];
    }
}
```

### Assumptions
- The chatbot will use a predefined set of rules to respond to user inputs.
- The chatbot will not have advanced natural language processing (NLP) capabilities.
