ies as per format (Section - N) reaching \nWTL by 07-09-26 at 3 PM. will be taken for \ndecision. \nInterest bidders are requested to send mail to \npurchase@wtl.co.in for participation of online pre-\nbid meeting. Based on request WTL will share \nmeeting id / links for meeting. If there is any \nchange in date and time, then will inform. \n \n8. \nBid Submission Start date & time \n15-09-2026 at 2 PM \n9. \nLast date & time of EMD & Tender Fee \nsubmission intimation. \nBefore Uploading of Tender \n10. \nLast date & time of Bid Submission \n22-09-2026 at 2 PM \n11. \nDate & time of Technical Bid Opening \n24-09-2026 at 2 PM \n12. \nWTL Address \n(A Govt. of West Bengal Undertaking) \nPlot - 5, Block - BP, Sector - V, Salt Lake City, \nKolkata - 700091. \n13. \nContact person \n033-23673403-06\n\n[Table 1]\n1. | Tender No. & Date | WTL/WBPNB/CCTV/26-27/046 Dated 01-09-2026\n2. | Tender Version No. | 1.0\n3. | Brief description of material | Supply, Installation, Testing, Commissioning of ANPR & IP Based CCTV Surveillance system of 09 Police District & 01 Commissionerate and Supply of Body Worn Camera & Night Vision Binocular under Inspector General of Police (North Bengal Region), West Bengal\n4. | Tender Fee | Rs.6000 (Rs Six Thousand only). The amount to be transferred online through e-tender portal.\n5. | Earnest Money Deposit | Rs. 16,00,000.00 (Sixteen Lacs Only). The amount to be transferred online through e-tender portal.\n6. | Date of Downloading | 01-09-2026\n7. | Pre-Bid Meeting date & time | 08-09-2026 at 4 PM. (Online) \uf0b7 Pre-Bid meeting will be organized in online platform only. \uf0b7 Only queries as per format (Section - N) reaching WTL by 07-09-26 at 3 PM. will be taken for decision. \uf0b7 Interest bidders are requested to send mail to purchase@wtl.co.in for participation of online pre- bid meeting. Based on request WTL will share meeting id / links for meeting. If there is any change in date and time, then will inform.\n8. | Bid Submission Start date & time | 15-09-2026 at 2 PM\n9. | Last date & time of EMD & Tender Fee submission intimation. | Before Uploading of Tender\n10. | Last date & time of Bid Submission | 22-09-2026 at 2 PM\n11. | Date & time of Technical Bid Opening | 24-09-2026 at 2 PM\n12. | WTL Address | WEBEL TECHNOLOGY LIMITED (A Govt. of West Bengal Undertaking) Plot - 5, Block - BP, Sector - V, Salt Lake City, Kolkata - 700091.\n13. | Contact person | 033-23673403-06\n\n=== SOURCE: Tendernotice_1.pdf | Page 27 ===\nWEBEL TECHNOLOGY LIMITED \n \n27 \n WTL/WBPNB/CCTV/26-27/046 Dated 01-09-2026 \nFor the purpose of placing the order, the proposals shall remain valid till 180 days. During the period \nof validity of proposals, the rates quoted shall not change. In exceptional circumstances, WTL may ask \nfor extension of the period of validity and such a request shall be binding on Bidders. WTL\u201fs request \nand the response to such a request by various Bidders shall be in writing. A Bidder agreeing to such \nan extension will not be permitted to increase its rates. \n \n \n40. TAXES & DUTIES \n\uf0b7 \nThe prices shall be inclusive of all taxes & levies including GST and other statutory duties as \napplicable. Rate of taxes should be indicated separately in the Price Bid. \nContract Price specified in Price Bid should be based on the taxes & duties and charges \nprevailing at the date one day prior to the last date of Bid submission. \nStatutory deduction, wherever applicable, shall be made from invoice as per government \nrules. Necessary certificate will be issued for such deductions. \nBidder submitting a bid shall produce valid statutory documents / certificates with respect to \nGST, Income Tax, ROC, Prof. Tax, Trade License, etc. All such documents / certificates shall \nremain valid on the last date of tender submission. \nIn case of inter-state transaction, WTL will provide \"Waybill\". However, statutory charges, if \nany will be borne by the bidder. \nGST component of the invoi