The tender eligibility criteria include:
*   Technical experience
*   Project implementation experience
*   Services and Support infrastructure in West Bengal
*   Financial capability

Additionally, bidders must meet the Eligibility criteria for the tender to be considered for technical evaluation (Tendernotice\_1 (1).pdf Page 8).

The technical evaluation criteria are:
*   Adherence to the specifications for Active and Passive Components specified in the BOQ and technical specifications of each equipment.
*   Manufacturers’ Authorization (MAF) for the bidder to supply the equipment from the OEM.
*   OEM eligibility for the item quoted, as per the OEM eligibility terms and conditions specified in the tender. All OEMs of primary equipment, such as IP CCTV, Software, Network Switch, Network Cables etc.
